{"unit_id":"wangser10032__dsh-model-autoconfig#feature-reasoning","repo":"wangser10032/dsh-model-autoconfig","commit":"149f54917121ba5f309ac6b2fe7f613b44379b09","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-autoconfig 的功能「补齐思考档位」：插件监听模型设置变化，根据模型目录或网关数据生成思考档位配置并写回 DSH；无法确认的模型信息会保留现有配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh/sync.mjs:212-278"]}
{"unit_id":"wangser10032__dsh-model-autoconfig#feature-capabilities","repo":"wangser10032/dsh-model-autoconfig","commit":"149f54917121ba5f309ac6b2fe7f613b44379b09","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-autoconfig 的功能「补全模型能力」：同步时合并模型已有声明、网关返回信息和模型资料，补充支持的输入模态等能力，并更新模型配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh/sync.mjs:212-278"]}
{"unit_id":"wangser10032__dsh-model-autoconfig#feature-gateway","repo":"wangser10032/dsh-model-autoconfig","commit":"149f54917121ba5f309ac6b2fe7f613b44379b09","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-autoconfig 的功能「发现网关模型」：自定义路由尚无模型 ID 时，插件可按已配置的 API 地址查询模型列表；失败时仍可由用户手动添加模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh/plugin.mjs:163-205"]}
