{"unit_id":"wangser10032__dsh-model-autoconfig#readme-1","repo":"wangser10032/dsh-model-autoconfig","commit":"149f54917121ba5f309ac6b2fe7f613b44379b09","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-autoconfig README · dsh-model-autoconfig：自动修正 dsh 模型的**思考模式**和**模型能力**。\n\n适用于官方 API 和 Coding Plan、硅基流动、火山方舟、阿里百炼、OpenRouter，以及常见中转站。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-model-autoconfig"}
{"unit_id":"wangser10032__dsh-model-autoconfig#readme-2","repo":"wangser10032/dsh-model-autoconfig","commit":"149f54917121ba5f309ac6b2fe7f613b44379b09","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-autoconfig README · 为什么需要这个插件：dsh 自带的模型目录并不完整，部分模型的思考档位和能力配置会缺失或写错。\n\n以当前 pi-ai 模型目录为例：\n\n```text\n模型总数          1290\n声明了思考档位     543\n缺少 off 档        151\n```\n\n缺少 `off` 会让 dsh 错误判断模型的思考状态，可能导致：\n\n- 思考模式无法正确开启或关闭\n- 思考档位显示错误\n- 长输出被意外截断\n\n插件会补上正确的 `off` 和思考档位，避免这些问题。","source":"extracted","section":"为什么需要这个插件"}
{"unit_id":"wangser10032__dsh-model-autoconfig#readme-3","repo":"wangser10032/dsh-model-autoconfig","commit":"149f54917121ba5f309ac6b2fe7f613b44379b09","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-autoconfig README · 插件会做什么：1. **修正思考模式**\n   - 模型是否支持思考\n   - 思考能否关闭\n   - 支持哪些档位，例如 Low、High、Max\n   - 按模型记住你最后选择的思考档位\n\n2. **自动配置模型**\n   - 根据模型厂商的官方资料填写正确参数\n   - 支持官方服务、第三方平台和中转站\n\n3. **补全模型能力**\n   - 是否支持图片输入\n   - 上下文长度\n   - 最大输出长度\n\n4. **检查错误配置**\n   - 无效或虚假的思考档位\n   - 漏掉的视觉能力\n   - 会被 dsh 拒绝的配置","source":"extracted","section":"插件会做什么"}
{"unit_id":"wangser10032__dsh-model-autoconfig#readme-4","repo":"wangser10032/dsh-model-autoconfig","commit":"149f54917121ba5f309ac6b2fe7f613b44379b09","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-autoconfig README · 安装：```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-model-autoconfig\n```\n\n安装后重启 dsh web。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"wangser10032__dsh-model-autoconfig#readme-5","repo":"wangser10032/dsh-model-autoconfig","commit":"149f54917121ba5f309ac6b2fe7f613b44379b09","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-autoconfig README · 使用：1. 打开 dsh 的 **Settings → Models**\n2. 添加模型服务，填写 API 地址和 API Key\n3. 获取模型列表或手动填写模型 ID，然后保存\n\n插件会自动完成其余配置，不需要手动修改 `settings.yaml`。\n\n你为某个模型选择思考档位后，插件会在当前浏览器中记住它。以后切回该模型，会自动恢复上次档位。","source":"extracted","section":"使用"}
{"unit_id":"wangser10032__dsh-model-autoconfig#readme-6","repo":"wangser10032/dsh-model-autoconfig","commit":"149f54917121ba5f309ac6b2fe7f613b44379b09","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-autoconfig README · 没有模型列表怎么办：部分中转站没有模型列表接口，直接手动填写模型 ID 即可。\n\n插件会尝试识别模型。无法确认的模型会原样保留，不会添加未经确认的能力。","source":"extracted","section":"没有模型列表怎么办"}
{"unit_id":"wangser10032__dsh-model-autoconfig#readme-7","repo":"wangser10032/dsh-model-autoconfig","commit":"149f54917121ba5f309ac6b2fe7f613b44379b09","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-autoconfig README · 如何确认生效：重新打开模型选择器：\n\n- 思考模型会显示正确的思考档位\n- 支持视觉的模型可以发送图片\n- 上下文和最大输出长度会被正确设置\n\n如果没有立即更新，请刷新网页或重启 dsh web。","source":"extracted","section":"如何确认生效"}
{"unit_id":"wangser10032__dsh-model-autoconfig#readme-8","repo":"wangser10032/dsh-model-autoconfig","commit":"149f54917121ba5f309ac6b2fe7f613b44379b09","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-autoconfig README · 卸载：```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-model-autoconfig\n```\n\n卸载后重启 dsh web。","source":"extracted","section":"卸载"}
